  "lineage": "Music for nat pwe, the Burmese ceremonies in which nat kadaw spirit mediums dance to invite and embody the nats, the spirits of the pantheon of thirty-seven and of local cults. A hsaing waing ensemble led by the pat waing drum circle and the hne shawm plays while a singer performs the songs belonging to each spirit; the largest gatherings are the annual festivals at Taungbyone near Mandalay and at Mount Popa.",
